* Feat/tick context narrow logs (#1273)

* perf(crawler): scope TickContext prefetch to relevant logs only
processLogs passed the full provider log batch into TickContext, making
prefetchBlockTimestamps fetch timestamps for blocks whose logs were
filtered out by formatLog. Narrow to `parsed` so only blocks with events
we actually handle get prefetched.
processLogsParallelBatch now passes `[]` — batch handlers request the
timestamps they need via `context.getBlockTimestamps(uniqueBlocks)`,
which batch-fetches and caches lazily for same-tick reuse. Avoids
double-fetching blocks the handler wouldn't look up.

