When a previous proposal exists, return lastSavedProposal.incrementalId + 1
directly instead of spawning a BlockchainLogCrawler that could scan millions
of blocks. The indexer processes events sequentially, so the increment is
always correct. Includes a guard against invalid incrementalId values (NaN)
and a duplicate-check safety net.
